{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>After</b> After five years. Some say that this Haman is Memucan." "<b>Above all the princes.</b> The meaning is above all the thrones of the princes, for every prince has a throne in the royal palace."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:30:05.928353815Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}